---
title: Transaction list request sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(173,216,230) Compute
        participant LegendCompute as Compute
        participant CardServicingUi as Card Servicing UI
        participant ApiGateway as API gateway
        participant CardServicingService as Card Servicing service
    end
    box rgb(144,238,144) Data stores
        participant LegendDataStores as Data stores
        participant AzureManagedRedis as Azure Managed Redis
    end
    box rgb(211,211,211) External systems
        participant LegendExternal as External systems
        participant AuthService as Auth service
        participant ConfigService as Config service
        participant TransactionActivityService as Transaction Activity service
    end
    box rgb(244,204,204) Security
        participant LegendSecurity as Security
        participant AccountAccessGuard as Account access guard
    end
    box rgb(255,255,224) Networking
        participant LegendNetworking as Networking
    end

    %% Stage 0 Receipt: no network call, Config included, before validation passes
    CardServicingUi->>ApiGateway: GET transactions page with bearer token
    ApiGateway->>CardServicingService: Forward request and bearer token
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Start 900 ms deadline,<br/>read config snapshot
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Validate accountId,<br/>typeCode<br/>and categoryCode
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Check pageSize 1 to 100,<br/>at most max_page_size
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Decode pageToken,<br/>version 1, fingerprint<br/>of account and filters
    break invalid parameter or page token
        CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 400 fixed
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 400 INVALID_ARGUMENT, no upstream call
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 400 with traceId
    end

    %% Stage 1 Authentication: fails closed
    CardServicingService->>AccountAccessGuard: Check access to accountId
    break token missing, empty or not Bearer
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 401 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: UNAUTHENTICATED, no Auth call
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 401 with traceId
    end
    AccountAccessGuard->>AuthService: ValidateToken
    break token invalid, expired or malformed
        AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: UNAUTHENTICATED
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 401 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: UNAUTHENTICATED
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 401 with traceId
    end
    break Auth unavailable or deadline spent
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 503 or 504 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: UNAVAILABLE or DEADLINE_EXCEEDED
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504, no data read
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 or 504 with traceId
    end
    AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: Subject and roles

    %% Stage 2 Authorization: fails closed, then the Config refresh launches without being awaited
    AccountAccessGuard->>AuthService: AuthorizeAccountAccess for subject and accountId
    break allowed false
        AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: allowed false
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 403 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: PERMISSION_DENIED
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 403 PERMISSION_DENIED, no data read
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 403 with traceId
    end
    break Auth unavailable or deadline spent
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 503 or 504 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: UNAVAILABLE or DEADLINE_EXCEEDED
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504, no data read
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 or 504 with traceId
    end
    AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: allowed true
    AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Access allowed
    opt stale or absent config snapshot
        CardServicingService-)ConfigService: GetConfig background refresh, not awaited
    end

    %% Stage 3 Data read: a cached list page is served only while fresh, never stale
    par transaction page
        CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Read cached page
        AzureManagedRedis-->>CardServicingService: Fresh page, or miss
        opt no fresh page or Redis failure
            CardServicingService->>TransactionActivityService: ListTransactions, page size and token passed through
            TransactionActivityService-->>CardServicingService: items and next_page_token, or error status
            CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Store page with cachedAt on success
        end
    end
    Note over CardServicingService: Cut-off at or before 900 ms

    %% Stage 4 Respond: after the cut-off, inside the remaining 100 ms
    alt page read
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 200 items, nextPageToken only if more
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 200 with dataStatus FRESH
    else no match or unknown filter code
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 200 with empty items
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 200 with dataStatus FRESH
    else account unknown
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 404 NOT_FOUND
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 404 with traceId
    else upstream rejects page token, not retried
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 400 INVALID_ARGUMENT,<br/>details field pageToken
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 400 with traceId
    else upstream unavailable or deadline spent
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 UNAVAILABLE or 504 DEADLINE_EXCEEDED
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 or 504 with traceId
    end
    Note over LegendCompute,LegendNetworking: The service checks access, then reads one<br/>keyset page of the account's transactions,<br/>newest processed first. An absent<br/>nextPageToken ends the list.
